Package: argon-oneup-power-profiles
Version: 1.3.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, iw, systemd
Provides: power-profiles-daemon, rpi-power-profiles, argon-power-profiles (= 1.3.3)
Conflicts: power-profiles-daemon, argon-power-profiles (<< 1.3.3)
Replaces: power-profiles-daemon, argon-power-profiles (<< 1.3.3)
Description: Hardware Power Profiles Daemon for Argon ONE UP Laptop
 Drop-in replacement for power-profiles-daemon on the Argon ONE UP Laptop
 (Raspberry Pi Compute Module 5) where ACPI platform drivers are absent.
 Exports standard org.freedesktop.UPower.PowerProfiles and net.hadess.PowerProfiles
 D-Bus APIs for KDE Plasma, GNOME, and powerprofilesctl.
 Dynamically manages:
  - CPU Governors (powersave @ 1500MHz, schedutil 1ms dynamic, performance @ max freq)
  - PCIe ASPM & Kernel Workqueue Power Efficiency per profile
  - WiFi Power Saving (powersave on / off)
  - Display Backlight with per-profile memory and automatic restore
